# ============================================================================
# Cloud Engineer 30-Day Program - .gitignore
# Repo root: cloud-engineer-30/
#
# Principles:
#   1. Proof stays in: notes, scripts, policies, and console screenshots are
#      the portfolio evidence for this program and are committed on purpose.
#   2. Secrets never enter: credentials, keys, and variable files with real
#      values are excluded before anything else.
#   3. Generated state stays out: Terraform state, dependency folders, and
#      caches are rebuilt from source, never committed.
# ============================================================================

# --- Secrets and credentials (never commit) --------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
**/credentials
*password*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
.aws-sso-cache/

# --- Terraform (Day 6 and Week 2) -------------------------------------------
# State files can contain sensitive values and must never be committed.
# .terraform.lock.hcl is NOT ignored: commit it, it pins provider versions.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# --- Cloud CLI and tool caches ----------------------------------------------
.azure/
gha-creds-*.json

# --- Python (SmartLead, scripts, Week 2+) ------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# --- Node / JavaScript --------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.next/
.npm/
.eslintcache

# --- Recordings and large media ----------------------------------------------
# Drill recordings: GitHub rejects files over 100 MB and large media bloats
# every clone. Keep recordings with the day's notes locally, or publish them
# via GitHub Releases / Git LFS. Small audio (mp3, m4a) may still be committed.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.avi
*.webm

# --- Logs, temp, and backups --------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
tmp/
temp/

# --- OS and editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*Zone.Identifier
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.misc

# --- Explicitly kept (do not ignore) ------------------------------------------
# week1/*/screenshots/*.png  - console evidence, committed on purpose
# **/*.tfvars.example        - variable templates with placeholder values
# .terraform.lock.hcl        - provider version lock, commit it
